invariant: INV-36
file: build.zig
catches: test/tx-record-builds.sh
reason: build.zig admits TX_RECORD=16385, which the Makefile refuses, so
  the two builds stop refusing the same values. cfg.h still stops the
  compile, but the Zig build writes the define first, and
  test/zig-build-check.sh compares only values both builds accept, so
  only the refusal check at the edge objects.

--- old
    return n >= 512 and n <= 16384;
--- new
    return n >= 512 and n <= 16385;
